{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45546","headline":"乐仙观 · 若虚","name":"乐仙观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐氏骑龙上碧天，东吴遗宅尚依然。\n悟来大道无多事，真後丹元不值钱。\n老树夜风虫咬叶，古垣春雨藓生甎。\n松倾鹤死桑田变，华表归乡未有年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"若虚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45546.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45546","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}